{"id":1827882,"retrievedAt":"2026-11-17T20:03:53.307Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/wGVLmiQXQSkNCbP8IZ1EJe0pohw.jpg","belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[{"id":12,"name":"Adventure"},{"id":99,"name":"Documentary"}],"homepage":"https://www.youtube.com/@mathys-mercier","id":1827882,"imdb_id":null,"origin_country":["FR"],"original_language":"fr","original_title":"La Grande Traversée du Jura à 18 ans ( Ultra-Trail )","overview":"It started as just an idea. A little crazy, probably way too big: running across the Jura Mountains, from Culoz to Les Rousses. 90 miles, 18,000 feet of elevation gain, alone against the mountain. For months, I prepared everything: training runs in the rain, the doubts, the sponsors I had to win over, the people close to me who thought I'd lost my mind. Then, on October 27 at 7 a.m., I set off. What happened next, I never saw coming. The night, the cold, the setbacks, the moments when your body says stop and all you have left is your mind. Naps on the side of the trail, and sunrises that make you want to keep going. 34 hours and 50 minutes in the Jura, with nothing held back. This film tells the story of how the project was born, the preparation, the people who carried me, and the two days that changed everything. It's the story of a challenge, but above all, of everything it took to make it to the end. Or not.","popularity":0.0582,"poster_path":"/akBMQbm20EspvJLLCO1E2SqTAhU.jpg","production_companies":[],"production_countries":[],"release_date":"2027-02-13","revenue":0,"runtime":0,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[{"english_name":"French","iso_639_1":"fr","name":"Français"}],"status":"Post Production","tagline":"","title":"Crossing the Jura Mountains at 18 | Ultra-Trail","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[{"iso_3166_1":"FR","title":"GTJ","type":""},{"iso_3166_1":"FR","title":"145km à 19 ans ( Ultra-Trail )","type":""}]},"credits":{"cast":[{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":51